.TH "TODOPRO GOALS SET" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro goals set Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-goals\-set \- Set a goal.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro goals set
[OPTIONS] GOAL_TYPE VALUE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set a goal.
.PP
Remote: `todopro goals set daily 5` (tasks per day/week, server-persisted).
Local:  `todopro goals set daily-sessions 8` (focus-session targets).
